msgid ":mod:`!smtpd` --- SMTP Server"
msgstr ":mod:`!smtpd` --- Server SMTP"

msgid ""
"This module is no longer part of the Python standard library. It "
"was :ref:`removed in Python 3.12 <whatsnew312-removed>` after being "
"deprecated in Python 3.6.  The removal was decided in :pep:`594`."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini bukan lagi bagian dari pustaka standar Python. Modul "
"ini :ref:`dihapus pada Python 3.12 <whatsnew312-removed>` setelah dinyatakan "
"usang pada Python 3.6. Penghapusan ini ditetapkan dalam :pep:`594`."

msgid ""
"A possible replacement is the third-party :pypi:`aiosmtpd` library. This "
"library is not maintained or supported by the Python core team."
msgstr ""
"Pengganti yang mungkin adalah pustaka pihak ketiga :pypi:`aiosmtpd`. Pustaka "
"ini tidak dipelihara atau didukung oleh tim inti Python."

msgid ""
"The last version of Python that provided the :mod:`!smtpd` module was "
"`Python 3.11 <https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/smtpd.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Versi terakhir Python yang menyediakan modul :mod:`!smtpd` adalah `Python "
"3.11 <https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/smtpd.html>`_."
